    {
      "bbox": [
        321,
        1167,
        1636,
        1372
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The newest blizzard to strike our city, one which is still continuing as I issue this statement, presents us with emergency conditions. The efforts of the Sanitation Department to keep open the major arteries so that the life-lines of food and fuel may be maintained, is being hampered seriously by stalled vehicles.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2564,
          "min": -1.5057
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 61,
          "mean": -0.0055,
          "min": -0.2884
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1797,
        "area_px": 271096,
        "density": 0.00663,
        "chars": 316,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 175.85
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        321,
        1407,
        1617,
        1491
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The stalling of additional vehicles brought out on the road would further hamper the work which must and will be done.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.237,
          "min": -1.4128
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 24,
          "mean": -0.0015,
          "min": -0.03
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 773,
        "area_px": 110245,
        "density": 0.00701,
        "chars": 118,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 152.65
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        321,
        1524,
        1674,
        1886
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Under the general emergency powers vested in the Mayor, I am therefore ordering from the streets, until further notice, all vehicular traffic beyond public transportation, including taxis, food and fuel trucks, emergency vehicles such as fire, police, hospital and sanitation equipment, and private vehicles performing emergency services, such as utility emergency repairs and communications vehicles, including newspaper trucks, cars used by doctors on emergency calls and transportation necessary to bring patients to hospitals.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2581,
          "min": -1.8399
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 87,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.005
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4896,
        "area_px": 490148,
        "density": 0.00999,
        "chars": 530,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 108.25
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        331,
        1919,
        1599,
        2042
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Police Department is ordered to enforce this ruling in the spirit in which it is laid down. The public cooperation is required.",
